  "notes": "- {言|い}い{当|あ}てる → {言|い}い{当|あ}てない (negative)\n- {言|い}い{当|あ}てる → {言|い}い{当|あ}てて (te-form)\n- {言|い}い{当|あ}てる → {言|い}い{当|あ}てた (past)\n\nFORMS:\nCompound verb: ⟦{言|い}う→言う：00515_iu⟧ (to say) + ⟦{当|あ}てる→当てる：01864_ateru⟧ (to hit the mark)\n\nUSAGE:\n- ⟦{正解|せいかい}→正解：03083_seikai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{言|い}い{当|あ}てる (to guess the correct answer)\n- ⟦{本心|ほんしん}→本心：12864_honshin⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{言|い}い{当|あ}てる (to hit upon someone's true feelings)\n- ⟦{未来|みらい}→未来：03748_mirai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{言|い}い{当|あ}てる (to predict the future correctly)\nImplies impressive accuracy, not just a lucky guess. Often used when someone demonstrates insight or intuition.",
